囊体半径','噴射膠囊體半徑'},['description']='If greater than 0, it\'s uses physics overlap test instead of relying on the projectiles hitting. Experimental!',['evidence']='struct',['owner']='SprayWeaponComponent',['member']='spray_capsule_radius',['group']={'Spray capsule radius','喷射胶囊体半径','噴射膠囊體半徑'},['group_key']='spray_capsule_radius'},['24:u64']={['offset']=24,['storage']='u64',['name']='warmup.shake.world_shake_effect',['labels']={'Shake · World shake effect','震动 · 世界震动特效','震動 · 世界震動特效'},['description']='[camera_shake]The shake effect to play in world. This is _not_ played if a local shake is played!',['evidence']='struct',['owner']='WeaponCameraShakeInfo',['member']='world_shake_effect',['group']={'Warmup','预热','預熱'},['group_key']='warmup'},['32:u64']={['offset']=32,['storage']='u64',['name']='warmup.shake.local_shake_effect',['labels']={'Shake · Local shake effect','震动 · 局部震动特效','震動 · 局部震動特效'},['description']='[camera_shake]The shake effect to play on the local player\'s camera (that is the camera of the player firing this weapon, if and only if the weapon is being fired by a player).',['evidence']='struct',['owner']='WeaponCameraShakeInfo',['member']='local_shake_effect',['group']={'Warmup','预热','預熱'},['group_key']='warmup'},['40:u64']={['offset']=40,['storage']='u64',['name']='warmup.shake.fpv_shake_effect',['labels']={'Shake · Fpv shake effect','震动 · 第一人称震动特效','震動 · 第一人稱震動特效'},['description']='[camera_shake]The shake effect to play on the local player\'s camera while firing this weapon in FPV.',['evidence']='struct',['owner']='WeaponCameraShakeInfo',['member']='fpv_shake_effect',['group']={'Warmup','预热','預熱'},['group_key']='warmup'},['48:f32']={['offset']=48,['storage']='f32',['name']='warmup.shake.inner_radius',['labels']={'Shake · Inner radius','震动 · 内层半径','震動 · 內層半徑'},['description']='Inner radius of the world shake',['evidence']='struct',['owner']='WeaponCameraShakeInfo',['member']='inner_radius',['group']={'Warmup','预热','預熱'},['group_key']='warmup'},['52:f32']={[